<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 4.6 pct in June 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 4.6 pct in June 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 4.6 percent in the June 1-10 period after falling 0.2 percent in the previous 10 days and were 4.3 percent higher than in the May 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				  JUNE 1-10    MAY 21-31   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	4.6	  -0.2	  4.3 (0.3)</p>
<p> Bread				0.0	   0.1	  0.2 (0.7)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  35.5	  -1.8	 31.3 (0.6)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.1	   0.1	  0.1 (0.5)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.4	   0.2	  0.8 (1.0)</p>
<p> Eggs				-3.3	  -1.8	 -7.7(-7.9)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on May 31.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
